{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_102mis0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_102mis0023_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6631126a43e127839b66e38484902cf71f1dff41146d5f3ac7e836efac6c6a42", "ja": "おはようございます……、あれ？\nその制服はたしか……。", "zh": "早上好……，咦？\n那套制服，我记得是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_102mis0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_102mis0023_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "9c9f8bd2270bf99f66ed9981e89f832be3d055461c04c853a80c49ef2af9ddd4", "ja": "劇場ができる前の、765プロの色違い制服です♪\n昨日、倉庫で見つけたんですよ！", "zh": "这是剧场建成前，765制作人的配色不同的制服♪\n昨天在仓库里找到的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_102mis0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_102mis0023_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "ad675e9d6048243cb872eb0eadc3420eb1bffaff760579881c6c8f3b4c3ec850", "ja": "社長さんに聞いてみたら、昔作ったまま、すっかり\n忘れてたみたいで。もったいないから着てみました！", "zh": "我去问了社长，他说是以前做好之后就完全忘掉了。放着太可惜，所以就穿来试试啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_102mis0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_102mis0023_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8918b15db942e26d3530312dd6c8d9c199006c0f4da5645fd28e0acb573a4a87", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことでしたか。\nいや、よくお似合いですよ！　なんだか新鮮だし。", "zh": "原来是这么回事啊。\n不，真的很适合您！感觉还挺新鲜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_102mis0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_102mis0023_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "1d93442671010998b7623d803989c76fffcc3262accfc594e4042046eda2e879", "ja": "わぁ、本当ですか？\nえへへ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "哇，真的吗？\n嘿嘿，谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_102mis0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_102mis0023_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "403bf6486e98144157e60a273f38eca6b6450a7d7004022c477d9b89cbc71cb7", "ja": "……アイドルのみんなも、きっといつも、\nこんな気持ちになってるんだろうなぁ……。", "zh": "……各位偶像平时，肯定也一直\n都是这种心情吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_102mis0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_102mis0023_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "a9bd736ba455a4dba71fc26fb6180a6c12c1c1cd55f0f7bf8c5cddc87edf3410", "ja": "ちなみに！　{$P$}さんは、\nいつもの制服とこの制服、どっちがお好きですか？", "zh": "顺便问一下！{$P$}先生先生，您更喜欢平时的校服，还是这套校服呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_102mis0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_102mis0023_1009_p", "source_sha256": "95a8b2b0561fe97e372de6c800b3d55a0ae8caa5ca78323cb103cb2dac127b8b", "ja": "えっ。それは……うーん……。\n気分によるというか……。", "zh": "诶，那是……嗯……怎么说呢，要看当时的心情吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
